# LB + RB inside the 60 ms combo window is F1; one tick past it, the buttons act on their own.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Combos
press lb
advance 59
press rb
advance 100
release lb rb
advance 100
press lb
advance 61
press rb
advance 100
release lb rb
---
key KEY_F1 down @59
key KEY_F1 up   @159
key KEY_Q down  @319
key KEY_E down  @380
key KEY_Q up    @420
key KEY_E up    @420
